scenarios = Array[String](["Acidic water is rising toward your waist in a flooded tunnel behind a rusted iron grate you must open to escape. You have a heavy steel crowbar, thick rubber gauntlets, and a fragile glass lantern.", "You need to retrieve a medkit pinned beneath a sleeping cave stalker's tail. You have a slab of raw venison, five meters of hooked rope, and a hunting knife.", "A boiler pipe is venting scalding steam across the only shutoff valve and is seconds from rupturing. You have insulated leather gloves, a long-handled wrench, and a wooden crate lid.", "A suspicious city guard demands to search your satchel, which holds stolen royal ciphers. You have twenty silver coins, a signed courier seal, and a smoke pellet.", "Two armored patrol automatons have cornered you in a narrow alley beneath a suspended cargo net of scrap iron. Next to you are the net's release lever, an oil canister, and a flare gun.", "Flames are creeping across an oil-soaked rug toward a locked wooden archive chest you must save. You have a soaked wool blanket, a bucket of sand, and an iron pry bar.", "Your heavy supply sled is stuck halfway across a groaning, cracked sheet of river ice. You have a winch cable anchored to the shore, two wide wooden planks, and a heavy pickaxe.", "You must reach the exit lever at the end of a pressure-tiled corridor lined with poison dart slits. You have a ten-foot wooden pole, a heavy tower shield, and a pouch of steel marbles.", "A severed high-voltage cable is sparking in a puddle directly in front of the airlock keypad you need to unlock. You have a fiberglass hook pole, rubber-soled boots, and a roll of electrical tape.", "The jailer's key ring hangs on a peg just inside a kennel guarded by a snarling warhound on a short chain. You have a drugged meat pie, a long broom handle, and a thick leather cloak."])

